          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Over 12 Lakh Indian Chemists Plan May 20 Shutdown Over Fake AI-Generated Prescriptions",
            "articleSection": "Policy & Rights",
            "abstract": "More than 1.2 million chemists across India are planning a nationwide shop shutdown on May 20 in protest against e-pharmacies that are allegedly enabling the use of AI-generated fake prescriptions to fulfil medicine orders. The chemists argue that AI tools are being used to fabricate prescription documents, bypassing regulatory safeguards and endangering patient safety. The protest marks a flashpoint in the broader conflict between traditional pharmacy networks and digital medicine platforms.",
            "url": "https://www.medianama.com/2026/05/223-chemist-strike-against-e-pharmacies-may-20-ai-generated-prescriptions/",
            "publisher": {
              "@type": "NewsMediaOrganization",
              "name": "The AI Chronicle",
              "url": "https://theaichronicle.com",
